        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1) Concerning the above classifications, all four will be combined into one (1) successor classification: Assembler Electronic Assembly, Labor Grade 11 (Job Code 41343). This will be done no later than January 5, 2002. Both parties may agree to mutually extend this date if necessary.",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                549,
                717,
                663
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
